    "sections": {
        "description": "The Consultancy Firm Theme is a professional, multipurpose solution crafted for modern consulting businesses such as business consultancy, management consulting, financial consulting, IT consulting, HR consulting, legal consulting, and tax consulting. Designed with a sleek, minimal, and intuitive layout, it offers full customization tailored to corporate and personal branding needs. Ideal for corporate strategy, business growth, market research, risk management, project management consulting, sales consulting, digital consulting, organizational development, investment consulting, and technology consulting, it also serves specialized niches including real estate consulting, SME consulting, staffing consultancy, recruitment agencies, leadership training, HR solutions, and change management. The theme’s responsive, mobile-friendly design ensures smooth navigation across all devices, while its optimized and secure code guarantees faster loading speed and reliable performance. Integrated with interactive banners, testimonial sections, CTAs, and social media links, it enhances user engagement and credibility. Built on the Bootstrap framework with shortcodes for easy layout customization, it supports translation readiness and SEO optimization for improved visibility. Fully compatible with WooCommerce for service payments, Contact Form 7 for lead generation, and WPML for multilingual functionality, the Consultancy Firm Theme empowers businesses to establish a global, professional, and high-performing online presence that drives growth and client trust."
    },
